                    Memoranda of Meetings with the President. Secret; Eyes Only. Apparently dictated
                    by McCone and transcribed in his office.
                        McCone retired as Director of
                    Central Intelligence on April 28 and was replaced by Admiral William F. Raborn, Jr. (USN, Ret.)</p>
